#
#
# ~chewygumxx/dotfiles.git
# ::: :/.agents/skills/.gitignore
#
#

#
# Skills installed by the skills CLI (npx skills ...) from skills-lock.json.
# The lock is their record; these copies are restored from it, so tracking
# them only invites drift (the header sync rewrites their path boxes, which
# then no longer match the lock's computedHash). .claude/skills is a link to
# this directory, so this file covers both of the CLI's destinations.
#
# One line per skill in skills-lock.json; add one whenever `skills add`
# adds to the lock. Skills written here by hand, and not in the lock, stay
# tracked.
#

/environment-variables/
/managing-dotfiles-with-chezmoi/
